u might get only one shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jeb’s journal &amp; story mysteries</strong> – Discover scattered pages from the previous caretaker. Learn survival tricks and uncover a slow‑burn horror narrative that explores why the last caretaker disappeared and what the Quiet Collapse left behind.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Caretaker’s Lease</i> blends realistic hunting simulation with a chilling sense of isolation. There’s no plague, no bombs just too much optimization and trust. The world is quieter, colder, and far more wild. You’re here to do a job, but the longer you stay, the more the land reveals about itself… and about you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And it doesn’t just whisper back   it remembers.</strong> <br>Notes left behind by the last caretaker suggest something deeper than tracks and tags.<br><i>“Blood runs warm beneath the frost…”</i><br><i>Some say it’s just a myth. Others say that’s why no one returns after winter.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Locals whisper about old myths   things that walk when the snow falls, creatures the Quiet Collapse never erased.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some say they’re just stories to scare new caretakers. Others swear the woods remember every scream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1778870635\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras_big/0556eb2c8407b1bf1411f357d6eca88b.avif?t=1778870635 width=1600 height=676 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/extras/13060d59bc182a102e8b58e5b5ab0679.avif?t=1778870635\" width=1309 height=1802 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "short_description": "Survive alone on Sagewater Island after the Quiet Collapse. Hunt, trap and track your prey in a grounded sim where every shot matters and the legacy of unchecked AI haunts the land.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/4ac09ecdf80f9b42934c1ccf41dd6ce0884c3518/header.jpg?t=1778870635", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/e2f51eb891379c1d6ca58bb6c05020edaa255c8c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778870635", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906970/e2f51eb891379c1d6ca58bb6c05020edaa255c8c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778870635", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2700x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3900x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2070<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong>